# ── Desktop (Tauri) Supabase browser client ─────────────────────────────────
# Vite only exposes vars prefixed with VITE_ (see apps/desktop/vite.config.ts
# `envPrefix`). Set these to the SAME Supabase project as the gateway's
# SUPABASE_URL / anon key. The anon key is public-safe (RLS-protected) and is
# the only Supabase credential the desktop ever holds — the service-role key
# never leaves the gateway.
#
# One-time dashboard setup: see docs/auth-supabase-setup.md (agent-os-architecture.md §4).
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=